    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n17586" root="زخ" body-key="z">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَزَخَّةٌ</span></b>  The <i>vulva</i> of a woman; (K, TA;)
because it is the place of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">الزَّخُّ</span>. (TA. [See <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">زَخَّ</span>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">المَرْأَةَ</span>.]) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  And (tropical:)  <i>A wife;</i> (S, A, K;) as though
she were the place of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">الزَّخُّ</span>; (TA;) as also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مِزَخَّةٌ</span></b> 
and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">زَخَّةٌ</span></b> . (K.)

